sequenceDiagram
    User ->> Client (GUI): Initiates login request
    Client (GUI) ->> Authentication Component: Send username/password
    Authentication Component ->> User Database: Validate credentials
    User Database ->> Authentication Component: Return validation result
    Authentication Component ->> Session Manager: Create session
    Session Manager ->> AuthPresenceInterface: Update user status to online
    AuthPresenceInterface ->> User Presence Component: Notify of status change
    User Presence Component ->> AdminPresenceInterface: Update active users list
    AdminPresenceInterface ->> Admin Interface: Display updated list